{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774220591166,"story":{"title":"Blobby's Big Brave Plan","userPrompt":"A blobfish who is tried of being made fun of and tries to be brave and be admired by his fellow fish.","authorStyleId":"barbara-park","readingLevel":"fluent","illustrationStyleId":"vector_flat","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"My name is Blobby, and I'm a blobfish. I know, I know. We aren't the cutest. All the other fish in Coral Cove giggle when I swim by. They say I look like a melted jelly bean. It's not very nice! I wish I was brave and cool, like Finn the fast fish. Or maybe even Shelly, the super smart seahorse!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby the blobfish looking sad, with other colorful fish swimming past and laughing. Setting: A bright coral reef with lots of plants and colorful fish. Color palette: Bright blues, greens, and pinks. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219836010,"durationMs":4521,"retries":0,"promptLength":577,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with sad expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby the blobfish looking sad as other fish swim by giggling and pointing at him. in Coral Cove, near some colorful coral formations. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, I had a GREAT idea. A plan so super, it would make all the fish clap! I would do a big, brave thing. Something no other fish had done before! That would show them I wasn't just a blob. I’d be Blobby, the BRAVE blobfish! I just needed to think of what that brave thing would be.","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby the blobfish with a determined look on his face, a lightbulb above his head. Setting: Blobby's simple home on the ocean floor, with a few rocks and plants. Color palette: Warm yellows, oranges, and browns. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219836295,"durationMs":4806,"retries":0,"promptLength":565,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with determined expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby looking determined and excited, a lightbulb appearing above his head. in Coral Cove, near a large clam shell. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"I asked Finn for advice. He zipped by so fast I almost missed him! \"Brave?\" he said. \"Easy! Race the shark!\" Race the shark?! That sounded like a TERRIBLE idea. Sharks have TEETH! I needed a plan that was brave but, you know, not too brave. Maybe just a tiny bit brave. Shark racing was out.","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby looking nervous as Finn, a sleek, fast fish, zips past him in a blur. Setting: A wide shot of the coral reef with a shadowy shark lurking in the distance. Color palette: Blues, greens, and grays with a pop of yellow for Finn. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220089356,"durationMs":9290,"retries":0,"promptLength":833,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with worried expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A small bright blue scales with white stripes fish, average yellow eyes with excited expression, streamlined body, large tail fin, sharp dorsal fin, always appears to be in motion, slim build. Blobby looking worried as Finn the fast fish zooms past, suggesting racing a shark. in Coral Cove, near a cluster of anemones. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"Next, I swam to Shelly. She was reading a book about starfish. \"Brave?\" she said, pushing up her tiny glasses. \"Explore the Deep Dark Cave!\" The Deep Dark Cave?! It was dark! And probably full of scary things! No way. I thanked Shelly and swam away. I was starting to think this brave plan was a bad idea.","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby looking scared as Shelly, a seahorse with glasses, points towards a dark, mysterious cave. Setting: A section of the reef near the cave entrance, with shadows and spooky-looking plants. Color palette: Dark blues, purples, and greens. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220061569,"durationMs":4691,"retries":0,"promptLength":881,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with scared expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A small pale yellow with brown spots seahorse, average light green eyes with intellectual expression, with small, round, wire-rimmed glasses, wears tiny glasses, always carries a book, curly tail, long snout, slim build. Blobby looking scared as Shelly the seahorse suggests exploring the Deep Dark Cave, which is visible in the background. in Coral Cove, near a pile of books and a dark cave entrance. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Then, I saw a little crab named Pinchy crying. \"What's wrong?\" I asked. Pinchy sniffled. \"My favorite shell blew away! It's stuck on that big, spiky plant!\" The plant was HUGE and had really pointy spikes. Even Finn and Shelly stayed far away from it!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby looking concerned at Pinchy the crab, who is crying. A large, spiky plant looms in the background with a shell stuck on one of its spikes. Setting: Near the spiky plant, with colorful coral and other sea creatures in the distance. Color palette: Bright colors with emphasis on the green and red of the spiky plant. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220052650,"durationMs":4316,"retries":0,"promptLength":812,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with concerned expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A tiny bright orange shell crab, small brown eyes with sad expression, small claws, one slightly bigger claw, always sniffling, bright orange color, average build. Blobby comforting Pinchy the crab, who is crying. A large, spiky plant with Pinchy's shell stuck on it is in the background. in Coral Cove, near a large, spiky plant. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"I didn't want Pinchy to be sad. And then, a small voice inside my head whispered, \"Maybe… maybe this is your brave thing.\" It wasn't shark racing or dark caves, but it was something. I took a deep breath. Okay, Blobby. You can do this! For Pinchy!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby looking determined, with a small smile. He is looking at the spiky plant with a determined expression. Setting: Close up on Blobby's face. Color palette: Warm colors, with a soft glow around Blobby. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220044047,"durationMs":11091,"retries":0,"promptLength":595,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with determined expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby looking determined but nervous, looking towards the spiky plant. in Coral Cove, close to the spiky plant. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"I slowly swam toward the spiky plant. It looked even bigger up close! I closed my eyes for a second. Then, I zoomed forward! I bumped into the plant, and the shell wobbled. I bumped it again! And POP! The shell came loose. I grabbed it and swam back to Pinchy.","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby bumping into the spiky plant, with the shell about to fall off. Setting: Close up of the spiky plant with Blobby nearby. Color palette: Bright, but slightly muted to convey the prickly feeling of the plant. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219845358,"durationMs":5449,"retries":0,"promptLength":550,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with focused expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby bumping into the spiky plant, dislodging the shell. in Coral Cove, right next to the spiky plant. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"Pinchy's eyes got HUGE. \"You… you got my shell!\" he cried. He gave me the biggest hug a crab could give. \"Thank you, Blobby! You're so brave!\" Brave? Me? I felt warm and fuzzy inside. Maybe being brave wasn't about racing sharks after all.","illustrationPrompt":"Pinchy hugging Blobby, with a look of gratitude on his face. Setting: Near the spiky plant, with other sea creatures watching in the background. Color palette: Warm and inviting colors, with a focus on the happiness of Blobby and Pinchy. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219849326,"durationMs":7284,"retries":0,"promptLength":693,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with happy expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A tiny bright orange shell crab, small brown eyes with grateful expression, small claws, one slightly bigger claw, always sniffling, bright orange color, average build. Pinchy hugging Blobby and looking grateful. in Coral Cove, near the spiky plant. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"Other fish started to swim closer. Even Finn and Shelly! \"Wow, Blobby!\" said Finn. \"That was really cool!\" Shelly nodded. \"Very brave indeed!\" I blushed. My face felt even more blobby than usual. But this time, I didn't mind.","illustrationPrompt":"Finn and Shelly looking impressed at Blobby and Pinchy. Other fish are gathering around, watching with admiration. Setting: The coral reef, with the spiky plant in the background. Color palette: Bright and cheerful colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219849387,"durationMs":4263,"retries":0,"promptLength":961,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with embarrassed expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A small bright blue scales with white stripes fish, average yellow eyes with impressed expression, streamlined body, large tail fin, sharp dorsal fin, always appears to be in motion, slim build. A small pale yellow with brown spots seahorse, average light green eyes with impressed expression, with small, round, wire-rimmed glasses, wears tiny glasses, always carries a book, curly tail, long snout, slim build. Finn and Shelly looking impressed at Blobby, who is blushing. in Coral Cove, near the spiky plant. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"From that day on, things were different. The other fish didn't giggle as much. They even asked me for help sometimes! Like when Sammy the snail lost his way. I helped him find his favorite rock. Or when Lulu the lobster got stuck in a bottle. I helped her get out!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby helping Sammy the snail find his rock and Lulu the lobster get out of a bottle. Setting: A montage of scenes showing Blobby helping other sea creatures. Color palette: Bright and playful colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219850442,"durationMs":5083,"retries":0,"promptLength":987,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with helpful expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. A tiny light brown, shiny shell snail, small dark blue eyes with relieved expression, long antennae, slightly cracked shell, leaves a shimmering trail, slow moving, slim build. A small dark red shell with blue claws lobster, small black eyes with grateful expression, long antennae, one slightly shorter claw, shiny shell, always wringing her claws, average build. Blobby helping Sammy the snail and Lulu the lobster in separate panels, or a combined scene. in Coral Cove, various locations (near a rock for Sammy, inside a bottle for Lulu). Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":11,"text":"I learned that being brave isn't about doing big, scary things. It's about being kind and helpful. And that even a blobfish can be brave. Even if he does look like a melted jelly bean. A brave, helpful, kind melted jelly bean!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby smiling happily, surrounded by his friends: Finn, Shelly, Pinchy, Sammy, and Lulu. Setting: The coral reef, with all the sea creatures together. Color palette: Warm and happy colors, with a focus on friendship and community. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774220023011,"durationMs":5875,"retries":0,"promptLength":604,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with confident expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby smiling confidently, surrounded by other happy fish. in Coral Cove, general area. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":12,"text":"So, if you ever see a blobfish, don't giggle! Say hello! And maybe, just maybe, ask him for help. Because even the blobbiest blobfish can be the bravest friend you'll ever have. And that's a super, duper, great thing to be!","illustrationPrompt":"Blobby waving goodbye to the reader with a big smile. Setting: A wide shot of the coral reef, with Blobby in the foreground. Color palette: Bright and cheerful colors, with a sense of warmth and happiness. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774219999508,"durationMs":4376,"retries":0,"promptLength":582,"success":true,"prompt":"clean vector illustration, flat digital art, modern minimalist style, smooth shapes, solid colors, crisp edges, contemporary design A small pale pink, slightly translucent skin with a blobby, droopy appearance blobfish, small small, black beady eyes eyes with friendly expression, droopy, melted appearance, small, pouty mouth, slightly translucent skin, small dorsal fin, chubby build. Blobby waving at the viewer, with a friendly expression. in Coral Cove, a welcoming and bright scene. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProvider":"flux2","gene